=80=93 where for better or worse, the genie cannot be put back into the bot=
tle. We do not yet know how historians will view the Great International Br=
eak of 2026, but one thing is for sure: the world has changed. Here is how =
this memorable three-week break from the Premier League has affected each o=
f this weekend=E2=80=99s fixtures.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;"><strong>Liverpool v Manchester City: </str=
ong>A remarkably quiet time for both sides, with <a href=3D"https://ablink.=
editorial.theguardian.com/ss/c/u001.Yw_JkLMEmFuifc_XG18IRyTNtZQ7fIEMgszcCSn=
