3eGciwBluFPQZzQ0g6SfK7uZsGN6EKNio-ZySJ2I" style=3D"color: #0077B6;">no sign=
ificant developments</a>. Should be a good, fair game between two historic =
rivals where we can just enjoy the purity and joy of football and Ayyoub Bo=
uaddi=E2=80=99s flowing locks without the machinations and influence of pol=
itics, sportswashing, legal verdicts and counter-claims. Can=E2=80=99t wait=
.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;"><strong>Chelsea v Bournemouth: </strong>Th=
e good news for Bournemouth over the break was that Alex Scott=E2=80=99s <a=
 href=3D"https://ablink.editorial.theguardian.com/ss/c/u001.Yw_JkLMEmFuifc_=
