B8vVuZTp2mM-o7iXHWd5OMHF0Krz6Eus" style=3D"color: #0077B6;">silky performan=
ces for England</a> have added another =C2=A340m to his value. The bad news=
 for Bournemouth =E2=80=A6 Scott is now <a href=3D"https://ablink.editorial=
