<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;"><strong>Manchester United v Tottenham: </s=
trong>Ranting and raving, toiling for weeks against lesser teams and strugg=
ling to get to grips with the ideas of his new continental manager, Andy Ro=
bertson has had better international breaks but should at least have some r=
espite when he returns to =E2=80=A6 ah. Yes <a href=3D"https://ablink.edito=
rial.theguardian.com/ss/c/u001.Yw_JkLMEmFuifc_XG18IRyTNtZQ7fIEMgszcCSneHECs=
NSdohjCkz2KMPsNd40iR3JHnTMTvC8JhBliUIQcTnDvZ2gOlNHJ1eaFkt4ifD1V9CYtYN7r1C2x=
